    "blast_radius": "Zero on the gate. None of the five gate models exercises the pad-concat-to-concat-pad miscompile under the --validate protocol, so the fix that repaired the silent wrong-gradient bug is invisible here. This confirms the fixes perturbed nothing that was already correct; it does NOT independently re-confirm the 3.64 -> 1.08e-12 repair, which rests on the separate targeted case.",
